  "$description": "Roundtable Souls design tokens (Owner decisions v2.5 A-F). W3C design-tokens shape. The ONE source: gen_theme.py writes qml-proto/Theme/Theme.qml and generated/theme_tokens.py from it; hand edits to those are a bug. Colours are '#RRGGBB', {colorSpace: oklch, components: [L, C, H]} (gamut-mapped) or a '{reference}'; $extensions.roundtable carries alpha (the alpha the role is used at), dL (an OKLCH lightness offset: hover +0.06 / press -0.10) and composite (flatten over an opaque colour).",
